# Command output written into the CWD. Running `regula governance` or
# `regula model-card` inside this repo drops these at the root, where
# `git add -A` will happily stage a scaffold full of [TO BE COMPLETED]
# placeholders. Root-anchored so docs/MODEL_CARD.md stays tracked.
/AI_GOVERNANCE.md
/MODEL_CARD.md
